{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_603_ap_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_603_ap_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b41555d51d7070a64c7b6205be684e35601587444436c6f249c5c82423e6665a", "ja": "えっ、肉体強化……？　そんな小道具あったかな……\nま、まあいいや、いただきます！", "zh": "咦，肉体强化……？有这种小道具吗……\n嘛，算、算了，先喝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
